# The four PRIVATE harness gates. They are REPO_GATES members that run in
# `make check`, and until 2026-08-13 none of them was tracked ANYWHERE —
# they existed only on one laptop. A fresh clone of the PRIVATE repo
# therefore skipped four ceiling gates and printed ok, with a message
# blaming a "public checkout". Tracked here, stripped at publish, the same
# way .github/dependabot.yml is.
!scripts/check-feature-lint.sh
