# The lane deriver's ungated list (P12). Public for the same reason internal/lane
# is: a public checkout that has the derivation but not the file recording which
# paths are deliberately outside it would refuse on every one of them. Same
# directory trap as scripts/installsh below — `scripts/*` excludes the DIRECTORY
# scripts/lib, so the directory must be re-included and its contents re-excluded
# before a single file can be named. gate-lib.sh deliberately stays private.
!scripts/lib/
